{"id":"design-underground-system","title":"Design Underground System","difficulty":"Medium","pattern":"Design","tags":["Hash Table","String","Design"],"companies":{"google":1,"apple":1,"amazon":3},"kind":"design","class_name":"UndergroundSystem","description":"Design the back end of a metro system that tracks journeys and reports average travel times between stations.\n\n- `UndergroundSystem()` creates the system.\n- `checkIn(id, stationName, t)` records that passenger `id` entered `stationName` at time `t`. A passenger can be checked in at only one station at a time.\n- `checkOut(id, stationName, t)` records that the same passenger left at `stationName` at time `t`, completing one journey from their check-in station.\n- `getAverageTime(startStation, endStation)` returns the mean duration, as a float, of **all** completed journeys that started at `startStation` and ended at `endStation`, in the order given. There is always at least one such journey when it is called.\n\nJourneys from A to B and from B to A are different routes. All times for a given passenger are increasing, and a passenger may travel again after checking out.","examples":[{"input":"[\"UndergroundSystem\",\"checkIn\",\"checkIn\",\"checkIn\",\"checkOut\",\"checkOut\",\"checkOut\",\"getAverageTime\",\"getAverageTime\",\"checkIn\",\"getAverageTime\",\"checkOut\",\"getAverageTime\"]\n[[],[45,\"Central\",3],[32,\"Harbor\",8],[27,\"Central\",10],[45,\"Museum\",15],[27,\"Museum\",20],[32,\"Airport\",22],[\"Harbor\",\"Airport\"],[\"Central\",\"Museum\"],[10,\"Central\",24],[\"Central\",\"Museum\"],[10,\"Museum\",38],[\"Central\",\"Museum\"]]","output":"[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,14.0,11.0,null,11.0,null,12.0]","explanation":"Central -> Museum journeys take 12 (passenger 45) and 10 (passenger 27), mean 11.0. Passenger 10 is still travelling when the second query happens, so it is unchanged; after their 14-unit trip the mean becomes 36/3 = 12.0."},{"input":"[\"UndergroundSystem\",\"checkIn\",\"checkOut\",\"getAverageTime\",\"checkIn\",\"checkOut\",\"getAverageTime\",\"getAverageTime\"]\n[[],[1,\"A\",0],[1,\"B\",5],[\"A\",\"B\"],[1,\"B\",6],[1,\"A\",14],[\"A\",\"B\"],[\"B\",\"A\"]]","output":"[null,null,null,5.0,null,null,5.0,8.0]","explanation":"The return trip B -> A is a separate route with its own average."}],"constraints":["1 <= id, t <= 10^6","1 <= stationName.length, startStation.length, endStation.length <= 10","At most 2 * 10^4 calls in total","getAverageTime is only called for a route with at least one completed journey"],"hints":["A check-in is pending state keyed by passenger id; a check-out consumes it.","You never need individual journey durations, only their sum and count per route.","Two maps: id -> (startStation, startTime), and (startStation, endStation) -> (totalTime, trips). The average is total / trips."],"starter":"class UndergroundSystem:\n    def __init__(self):\n        pass\n\n    def checkIn(self, id: int, stationName: str, t: int) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def checkOut(self, id: int, stationName: str, t: int) -> None:\n        pass\n\n    def getAverageTime(self, startStation: str, endStation: str) -> float:\n        pass\n","compare":"exact","tests":[{"input":{"ops":[["UndergroundSystem",[]],["checkIn",[45,"Central",3]],["checkIn",[32,"Harbor",8]],["checkIn",[27,"Central",10]],["checkOut",[45,"Museum",15]],["checkOut",[27,"Museum",20]],["checkOut",[32,"Airport",22]],["getAverageTime",["Harbor","Airport"]],["getAverageTime",["Central","Museum"]],["checkIn",[10,"Central",24]],["getAverageTime",["Central","Museum"]],["checkOut",[10,"Museum",38]],["getAverageTime",["Central","Museum"]]]},"output":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,14.0,11.0,null,11.0,null,12.0]},{"input":{"ops":[["UndergroundSystem",[]],["checkIn",[1,"A",0]],["checkOut",[1,"B",5]],["getAverageTime",["A","B"]],["checkIn",[1,"B",6]],["checkOut",[1,"A",14]],["getAverageTime",["A","B"]],["getAverageTime",["B","A"]]]},"output":[null,null,null,5.0,null,null,5.0,8.0]},{"in